    "rating": 3.7,
    "reference": "ChIJR_0ax7M3yUwREqJlpPSd_Z4",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Laurie-Anne Ranger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108830555804450245371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH_Nk_W1NyCkKI0IXhPbkw98twuBXOu8MqJF2RclIQIVNmfTw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We are so happy with our floors!  We removed the parquet floors from our upper levels and we are so happy with the results. Eric was a great help when we were trying to match our current main floor hardwood floors and our stairs. The match is perfect.  Special thanks to Mario for achieving exactly what we hoped for.  We are honored to be the last customers that he removed and installed floors for.  He did an excellent job.  He can help you with other projects.",
        "time": 1719866612,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Elena M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103460224651251163043/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEJv8-A644tIUYO5eQOigDlvQNetalQaBV1KmCfK49jjXBUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Do not recommend. Quality of tiles is bad, tiles are differently cut makes it hard to install by installer. Also thin. Can get better quality at Reno depot for cheaper. Their supply guy is rarely there, so that makes several trips to the store in order to get them loaded in my car. Mistakes while ordering several times by employees (wrong tiles) , price mistake (higher price than advertised). Also, was told by employees that there's 30 % restocking fee which turned out to  not be applicable in my case. Nothing VIP about the store, do not recommended. Ana-Maria is really nice but that's about it.",
        "time": 1712079589,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anja P",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116077329218798238919/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKgUajoiuTW1_zTCBjGIg02KiiaixJBzflswyLAp0efFCwxEQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "VIP has a great selection of tiles and a fantastic customer service. Thank you so much for your support and flexibility during our home renovation.",
        "time": 1743257668,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanda Styrczula-king",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118273818328988531866/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVM_po8izIQQJ38Fsyb5sSLH8zdqy5iBpUfs4mBHga0WV_46Hm6dg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Completely dissatisfied with the service and quality here, not to mention literal robbery.\nWe purchased floating floors here about a month ago ( very average quality for the price we payed). I had asked the service representative their policy on returns and he told me that as long is the box is not opened or damaged we could bring them back no problem. I ordered a large amount of flooring with intention to use all of it, however we changed our mind while waiting for our order to arrive and decided to put ceramic in the kitchen instead. Once we got the call that the order was ready ( 2 weeks late, they had told us it would be ready the next week) I had asked him again on the phone, \"we changed our mind and will be returning a large amount of the flooring\" once again he said no problem, take the pallet and bring back what you don't use. Once we went to pick up the pallet and pay, the bill said \" no return\" so once again I asked \" are You SURE I can bring these back. He says yes no issues. A few days later we go to return about 13 boxes of undamaged, unopened flooring and the same service rep begins to tell my boyfriend that there is a 30% restocking fee if we want to return the flooring and it says no returns on the bill. You can imagine how frustrating this was for us. Call the manager, does absolutely nothing. Called multiple times over the past month and got no call back. They took the flooring back and kept 150$ of our money. We renovate houses full time now and I can honestly say this was the worst customer service I've ever experienced with any sort of hardware or material store. Would never reccomend using them.",
        "time": 1600445890,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chloé",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109807576211667972953/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJcdtkraCVFgHQHS24vlIbU46GW-O8TVEhTHA724-qesUMog=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Bought our floors from plancher VIP. Service was ok. When the order was placed, I notified the lady who put the order to change it because I needed less floor than expected. I was told that it was too late and that there was no way to get a refund for the extra floors (I am now stuck with 12 extra boxes of hardwood floors) even though the floors hadn't even arrived yet, they simply didn't want to adjust the order. Make sure to have the EXACT number of square feet that you need because they will NOT refund you if you buy more than you need. Also, I bought a staining varnish they suggested to buy if I ever needed to do some touch-ups.. turns out they gave me the wrong colour. The nosing and my stairs turned completely yellow. In conclusion, the floor (the maple in the supreme grade ) is nice but it gets scratched and dents extremely easily, for the money I paid, I wouldn't buy from them again. Lost money and time.",
